<title>SINGAPORE: Major Aztech shareholder sells shares.</title>
<headline>Major Aztech shareholder sells shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Substantial shareholder AZT Holdings Pte Ltd sold a total of 10 million Aztech shares last Friday, according to a declaration to Stock Exchange of Singapore (SES) on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The sale comprise 2.53 percent of the company's issued share capital each were sold at Singapore $0.5675 cents each.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
